OL,5,B
OL,6, Mrs Margaret Thatcher and President
OL,7, Ronald Reagan are to meet for talks on
OL,8, the peace-keeping exercise in Lebanon.
OL,9,B
OL,10,BThe meeting will take place on Thursday
OL,11,Bin the US before Mrs Thatcher addresses
OL,12,Bthe United Nations General Assembly.
OL,13,B
OL,14,BIt is believed the talks will look at
OL,15,Bthe risk of US military involvement in
OL,16,Bthe area drawing the peace-keeping
OL,17,Bforces into a long conflict.
OL,18,B
OL,19,B
OL,20,B
OL,21,B
OL,22,B
OL,23,T]CFromG24-09-83C  teletextarchive.com
