OL,5,B
OL,6, A leading member of a group campaigning
OL,7, against "supergrass" informers has been
OL,8, arrested in Dublin.
OL,9,B
OL,10,BThe chairman of Relatives For Justice,
OL,11,BMs Moyra Berkery, was arrested by
OL,12,Bpolice in the Irish republic at Dublin
OL,13,Brailway station.
OL,14,B
OL,15,BShe is reported to have been on her way
OL,16,Bto have talks with solicitors about the
OL,17,Bpractice of using so-called supergrass
OL,18,Binformers in terrorist cases in
OL,19,BNorthern Ireland.
OL,20,B
OL,21,B
OL,22,B
OL,23,T]CFromG24-09-83C  teletextarchive.com
