OL,5,F
OL,6, A Dublin newspaper has claimed that
OL,7, three USSR citizens expelled from the
OL,8, Irish Republic had links with the IRA.
OL,9,B
OL,10,BThe three - two male diplomats and the
OL,11,Bwife of one of them - had recently been
OL,12,Bin contact with the Provisionals in
OL,13,BNorthern Ireland, the newspaper claimed
OL,14,B
OL,15,BThe Provisional IRA in Belfast has
OL,16,Bdenied that it was ever connected in
OL,17,Bany way with the expelled Soviets.
OL,18,B
OL,19,B
OL,20,B
OL,21,B
OL,22,B
OL,23,T]CFromG24-09-83C  teletextarchive.com
