OL,4,T]W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,6, The black box of the Gulf Air jet which
OL,7, crashed in the United Arab Emirates
OL,8, yesterday, is said to have been found.
OL,10,BSabotage is suspected as a cause of the
OL,11,Bcrash in which 111 people, including
OL,12,Bnine Britons, were killed.
OL,13,B
OL,14,BA team of experts are now in Karachi in
OL,15,BPakistan investigating the cause.
OL,16,B
OL,17,BThe airliner came down and caught fire
OL,18,Babout 30 miles from Abu Dhabi. It was
OL,19,Btrying to land at Abu Dhabi airport
OL,20,Bwhen it crashed.
OL,23,T]CFromG24-09-83C  teletextarchive.com
