OL,6,  BFrom Stuart Sykes at Brand's Hatch
OL,7,B
OL,8, The Lotus of Elio de Angelis has won
OL,9, pole position for tomorrow's European
OL,10, Grand Prix at Brand's Hatch.
OL,11,B
OL,12,BHis time of one minute 12.092 seconds
OL,13,Bput him ahead of the Brabham of Italian
OL,14,BRiccardo Patrese (1:12.458).
OL,15,B
OL,16,BBriton Nigel Mansell (Lotus) could not
OL,17,Bimprove on his best time from yesterday
OL,18,Band puts his Lotus in third spot ahead
OL,19,Bof the race favourite Nelson Piquet
OL,20,B(Brazil, Brabham).
OL,21,B
OL,22,B
OL,23,Q]BFromG24-09-83  Bteletextarchive.com
