OL,1,Q]R,,,,,,,,GNewport, Rhode IslandRF15/15
OL,2,Q]WBBC      z5{5+%z5k7j5k5#!
OL,3,Q]WSPORT    pz5j5x4j5j5j5j5z5
OL,4,Q]R,,,,,,,,,Gfrom Martin EverardR,,,,,,
OL,6, The America's Cup is still safe in
OL,7, America's hands - until Monday at
OL,8, least.
OL,10,BThe Race Committee postponed the final
OL,11,Band deciding race between the US
OL,12,Bdefender Liberty and the Australian
OL,13,Bchallenger Australia II because of lack
OL,14,Bof wind.
OL,16,BLiberty, needing to re-assess her trim
OL,17,Bfollowing yesterday's re-balancing, has
OL,18,Bcalled for a lay day tomorrow, so the
OL,19,Brace is now scheduled for Monday.
OL,21,BIt is the second time in the final
OL,22,Bseries that a lack of wind has forced
OL,23,Bthe cancellation of a race.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
